## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- `SMMA55_HIGH = iMA(NULL, PERIOD_H1, 55, 0, 3, PRICE_HIGH, shift)` — MODE_SMMA = 3 in MQL5
- `SMMA55_LOW = iMA(NULL, PERIOD_H1, 55, 0, 3, PRICE_LOW, shift)`
- `WPR55 = iWPR(NULL, PERIOD_H1, 55, 1)` — shift=1 for previous completed bar
- `STOCH_K = iStochastic(NULL, PERIOD_H1, 5, 5, 5, 0, STO_LOWHIGH, 1, 1)` — shift=1, 6th param=0 (no smoothing)
- Long entry: `iClose(H1,1) > SMMA55_HIGH[1]` AND `iWPR(H1,55,1) > -25` AND `iStoch(H1,5,5,5,...,1) > 50`
- SL for long: `SMMA55_LOW[1]` at time of entry — compute in pips, apply P2 cap
- Trail: on each new bar, update SL to `SMMA55_LOW[0]` if it has moved up (for long)
- P3 sweeps: SMMA period (34/55/89), WPR threshold (overbought -25/-20; oversold -75/-80), Stoch period (5/8/14), entry method (market/BUYSTOP), TP method (trail/fixed-60/fixed-100)

